>
> In my source, it is the block of code around line 23172 of
> the configure script:
>
> ------------------
> kde_line="$kde_line -impl actest.h actest.ui > actest.cpp"
> if { (eval echo "$as_me:$LINENO: \"$kde_line\"") >&5
>   (eval $kde_line) 2>&5
>   ac_status=$?
>   echo "$as_me:$LINENO: \$? = $ac_status" >&5
