The error message is
6202:/usr/bin/pg: /sbin/loader: Error: Unresolved symbol in /usr/bin/pg:
safe_open
6202:/usr/bin/pg: /sbin/loader: Fatal Error: this executable has
unresolvable symbols

When I do an "ldd /bin/pg" I get
      Main  => pg
      libcurses.so  => /usr/shlib/libcurses.so
      libc.so  => /usr/shlib/libc.so

No "safe_open".  I had trouble with libc.so (fixed), so I'm pretty sure
that's OK.

"more" (and its synonym "page") work just fine.  The applications people
want "pg," however, because it has some options they like.

